  "details": "# NotImplementedException on \"Copy Udon Name\"\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen using the VRChat SDK, right-clicking a class in the **Class Exposure Tree** and selecting **Copy Udon name** triggers a `NotImplementedException`. This occurs because the method responsible for computing and returning the Udon name is not yet implemented.\n\n## Environment\n\n- **VRChat SDK Version:** 3.8 (World and Base)\n\n## Relevant File\n\n- `UdonTypeExposureTree.cs`\n\n## Key Methods Involved\n\n- **`UdonTypeExposureTreeView.GetMemberUdonName`**  \n\n  Supposed to compute and retrieve the Udon name, but is currently unimplemented.\n\n  \n\n- **`UdonTypeExposureTreeView.OnClickCopyUdonName`**  \n\n  Handles the \"Copy Udon name\" context menu action.\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. **Open Unity Editor:**  \n\n   Launch the Unity Editor with VRChat SDK version 3.8 (World and Base) installed.\n\n2. **Access the Menu:**  \n\n   Navigate to **VRChat SDK > Udon Sharp > Class Exposure Tree**.\n\n3. **Load the Window:**  \n\n   Allow the **Class Exposure Tree** window to load completely.\n\n4. **Select a Class:**  \n\n   Click to select any class from the list.\n\n5. **Right-Click Action:**  \n\n   Right-click the selected class to open the context menu.\n\n6. **Copy Udon Name:**  \n\n   Choose the **Copy Udon name** option from the context menu.\n\n7. **Error Occurrence:**  \n\n   The Unity Editor displays a `NotImplementedException` error message, indicating that the feature is not fully implemented.\n\n## Proposed Implementation\n\nI created a custom implementation to address this issue. You can review my implementation [here](https://gist.github.com/JordanRO2/93da0667409852a9b63102426f2bb6cc).",
